.env

# JWT-AUDIT-2026-05 / item 9: defense-in-depth — even though
# `ops/trello.md` is not currently tracked, lock the door against
# anyone re-adding `key=…&token=…` blobs back into committed paths.
**/trello.env
**/.trello-creds*
**/*-secrets/

# B8 (2026-05-11): local audit log of every --prod deploy attempt
# (allowed / blocked + reason). Useful per-operator forensics, but
# noisy and machine-specific — don't push it to origin.
ops/prod-deploys.log

